@HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5177

### Get all habits
GET {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/habits
Accept: application/json

###

### Get only archived habits
GET {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/habits?isArchived=true
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a specific habit by ID (Assuming ID 1 exists)
GET {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/habits/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new habit
POST {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/habits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Drink Water",
  "description": "Drink at least 2 liters a day",
  "targetPerWeek": 7
}

###

### Update a habit
PUT {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/habits/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Drink More Water",
  "description": "Updated goal: 3 liters a day",
  "targetPerWeek": 7,
  "isArchived": false
}

###

### Archive a habit
PATCH {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/habits/1/archive

###

### Log a check-in for a habit
POST {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/checkins
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "habitId": 1,
  "date": "2026-02-08",
  "note": "Drank 3 liters, feeling great!"
}

###

### Get all check-ins for a specific habit
GET {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/checkins/habit/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete a check-in record
DELETE {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/checkins/1

###

### Delete a habit
DELETE {{HabitTrackerApi_HostAddress}}/api/habits/1
